OL,3,GNEWSAHydrotherapy pool helps injured
OL,4,Afox cub to recover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fox cub is having swimming sessions
OL,7,Fin a hydrotherapy pool to help his
OL,8,Frecovery after he was hit by a car.
OL,10,FChance, as his rescuers have aptly
OL,11,Fnamed him, lay injured by the roadside,
OL,12,Fwith his back legs immobile, for days
OL,13,Fbefore he was spotted by a member of
OL,14,Fthe public.
OL,16,FVets who examined him initially thought
OL,17,Fhe may have to be put down, but
OL,18,FMansfield Wildlife Rescue in
OL,19,FNottinghamshire stepped in to
OL,20,Frehabilitate him.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
