OL,3,GNEWSAHydrotherapy pool helps injured
OL,4,Afox cub to recover
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis has involved assisted swimming
OL,7,Fwith his designated carer from the
OL,8,Frescue at an indoor hydrotherapy pool,
OL,9,Fusually used by dogs at the Mansfield
OL,10,FCanine Centre, to help rebuild his
OL,11,Fconfidence and strength.
